{%- comment -%}
  "Object in focus" — one CAVIERA piece studied in detail, with sequential editorial chapters
  (Stone, Setting, Gold, Silhouette, Craft, Hallmark…) beside it.

  VISUAL-TUNING FIX: this used to show the quiet "no media" CAVIERA material composition (Cinnabar
  panel + Warm Bone inset + optional faint House Seal watermark) whenever no product/dedicated
  image was configured, which read as an unfinished placeholder rather than an object study. Media
  now always resolves to something real — a per-chapter dedicated image if a merchant has set one
  on that block, otherwise the section's own dedicated/product image, otherwise the same bundled
  default the hero uses (assets/15_oryx_necklace_on_model.png) — so the CAVIERA material
  composition below is now a genuine last-resort fallback (kept in the code, effectively
  unreachable by default) rather than the everyday state, exactly like the hero's and Edition I
  teaser's own bundled-default pattern.

  Nolan-style sticky object storytelling: each chapter with a title renders its OWN image state,
  stacked absolutely inside .caviera-object-focus__media (sticky at 1024px+, see caviera-home.css)
  and crossfaded by assets/caviera-object-focus.js via data-active-chapter on that element — a real
  image change per chapter, not just a container-level nudge. A chapter with its own dedicated image
  renders it as itself; a chapter with none reuses the section's base image with a distinct crop
  (data-derived="true" — see the per-index rules in caviera-home.css) so "Stone"/"Setting"/"Gold"
  always look like genuinely different states even when only one real photograph exists yet. This
  is an explicitly temporary editorial treatment per the visual-tuning brief — real per-chapter
  macro photography drops in per-block without any code change.

  With no chapters at all, the section falls back to the original single dominant image (respecting
  the Media fit setting below) — media_fit only applies in that fallback path now, since the
  chapter-stack above is deliberately always a considered crop.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign product = section.settings.product
  assign dedicated_image = section.settings.image
  assign dedicated_image_mobile = section.settings.image_mobile

  assign base_img = dedicated_image
  if base_img == blank and product != blank
    assign base_img = product.featured_image
  endif
  assign base_img_mobile = dedicated_image_mobile
  if base_img_mobile == blank
    assign base_img_mobile = base_img
  endif
  assign bundled_file = '15_oryx_necklace_on_model.png'
  assign use_bundled_base = false
  if base_img == blank
    assign use_bundled_base = true
  endif
  # has_media is now always true — the bundled default fills the gap exactly like the hero and
  # Edition I teaser, so the "composition" fallback further below is a genuine last resort, not the
  # everyday no-image state.
  assign has_media = true

  assign mark_mode = 'light'
  unless section.settings.color_scheme == 'bone'
    assign mark_mode = 'dark'
  endunless

  assign cta_url = blank
  if product != blank
    assign cta_url = product.url
  endif
  if section.settings.link_url != blank
    assign cta_url = section.settings.link_url
  endif
  assign cta_text = section.settings.link_text | default: 'Discover the object'

  assign has_chapters = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.body != blank
      assign has_chapters = true
    endif
  endfor
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  2026-08-18 — APPROVED CHAPTER PHOTOGRAPHY: Stone / Design / Gold now each have their own real,
  dedicated campaign photograph (assets/caviera-object-focus-stone-2026.jpg / -design-2026.jpg /
  -gold-2026.png) — bundled theme assets, per brief ("do not place in subfolders, main assets
  folder only"), not Shopify Files, so they can't be pre-selected through the Chapter block's own
  image_picker setting (that field only ever points at a merchant-uploaded File). Matched by
  chapter POSITION (1st/2nd/3rd chapter block), the same technique already used for this section's
  own bundled-default fallback and for the mobile nav's bundled preview images in sections/
  caviera-header.liquid — never by matching the chapter's title text, so it keeps working even if a
  merchant renames a chapter. A chapter block's own dedicated image (if a merchant sets one) always
  still wins outright; this is only the fallback for the common case where none is set — exactly
  like every other bundled-default in this theme.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign chapter_bundled_1 = 'caviera-object-focus-stone-2026.jpg'
  assign chapter_bundled_1_w = 736
  assign chapter_bundled_1_h = 1308
  assign chapter_bundled_2 = 'caviera-object-focus-design-2026.jpg'
  assign chapter_bundled_2_w = 1080
  assign chapter_bundled_2_h = 1350
  assign chapter_bundled_3 = 'caviera-object-focus-gold-2026.png'
  assign chapter_bundled_3_w = 1122
  assign chapter_bundled_3_h = 1402
-%}
<section class="caviera-section caviera-object-focus" data-scheme="{{ section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'bone' }}" data-spacing="{{ section.settings.spacing | default: 'standard' }}" data-mode="{% if has_media %}media{% else %}composition{% endif %}">
  <div class="container container--narrow caviera-object-focus__head">
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}<span class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</span>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}<h2 class="heading-h1 caviera-object-focus__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="container caviera-object-focus__grid">
    <div class="caviera-object-focus__media-col">
      {%- if has_chapters -%}
        <div class="caviera-object-focus__media" data-active-chapter="0">
          <span class="caviera-object-focus__media-offset" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.body != blank -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign chapter_img = block.settings.image
                assign chapter_derived = false
                assign chapter_own_bundled = blank
                case forloop.index
                  when 1
                    assign chapter_own_bundled = chapter_bundled_1
                    assign chapter_own_bundled_w = chapter_bundled_1_w
                    assign chapter_own_bundled_h = chapter_bundled_1_h
                  when 2
                    assign chapter_own_bundled = chapter_bundled_2
                    assign chapter_own_bundled_w = chapter_bundled_2_w
                    assign chapter_own_bundled_h = chapter_bundled_2_h
                  when 3
                    assign chapter_own_bundled = chapter_bundled_3
                    assign chapter_own_bundled_w = chapter_bundled_3_w
                    assign chapter_own_bundled_h = chapter_bundled_3_h
                endcase
                if chapter_img == blank and chapter_own_bundled == blank
                  assign chapter_img = base_img
                  assign chapter_derived = true
                endif
              -%}
              <div class="caviera-object-focus__media-state" data-state-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}" data-derived="{{ chapter_derived }}">
                {%- if chapter_img != blank -%}
                  <img
                    src="{{ chapter_img | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                    srcset="{{ chapter_img | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ chapter_img | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w, {{ chapter_img | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw"
                    width="{{ chapter_img.width }}" height="{{ chapter_img.height }}"
                    alt="{{ chapter_img.alt | default: block.settings.title | default: '' | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                  >
                {%- elsif chapter_own_bundled != blank -%}
                  <img
                    src="{{ chapter_own_bundled | asset_url }}"
                    width="{{ chapter_own_bundled_w }}" height="{{ chapter_own_bundled_h }}"
                    alt="{{ block.settings.title | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                  >
                {%- elsif use_bundled_base -%}
                  <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="{{ block.settings.title | escape }}" loading="lazy">
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="caviera-object-focus__media" data-fit="{{ section.settings.media_fit | default: 'contain' }}">
          {%- if base_img != blank or use_bundled_base -%}
            <span class="caviera-object-focus__media-offset" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <picture>
              {%- if base_img_mobile != blank and base_img_mobile != base_img -%}
                <source media="(max-width: 749px)" srcset="{{ base_img_mobile | image_url: width: 700 }} 700w, {{ base_img_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w" sizes="100vw">
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if base_img != blank -%}
                <img
                  src="{{ base_img | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                  srcset="{{ base_img | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ base_img | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w, {{ base_img | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
                  sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw"
                  width="{{ base_img.width }}" height="{{ base_img.height }}"
                  alt="{{ base_img.alt | default: product.title | default: '' | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                >
              {%- else -%}
                <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="" loading="lazy">
              {%- endif -%}
            </picture>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Controlled CAVIERA material field — genuine last resort now (unreachable by default,
              see the file-level comment above). Never a simulated photo.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="caviera-object-focus__composition" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="caviera-object-focus__composition-inset"></span>
            </div>
            {%- if section.settings.show_seal_watermark -%}
              <div class="caviera-object-focus__composition-seal" style="--seal-opacity: {{ section.settings.seal_watermark_opacity | default: 8 }}%;">
                {%- render 'caviera-house-seal', mode: mark_mode, width: 220, alt: '' -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="caviera-object-focus__story">
      {%- if has_chapters -%}
        <ol class="caviera-object-focus__chapters">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.body != blank -%}
              <li class="caviera-object-focus__chapter" data-chapter-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="caviera-object-focus__chapter-number label" aria-hidden="true">{% if forloop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ forloop.index }}</span>
                <div class="caviera-object-focus__chapter-copy">
                  {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}<h3 class="caviera-object-focus__chapter-title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.body != blank -%}<div class="body-text">{{ block.settings.body }}</div>{%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ol>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if cta_url != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ cta_url }}" class="link-underline caviera-object-focus__cta">{{ cta_text }}<span class="caviera-object-focus__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="{{ 'caviera-object-focus.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Object in focus",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "Featured object / product", "info": "Its featured image becomes the base image reused (with a distinct crop) by any chapter block below that has no image of its own." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Base image", "info": "Takes priority over the selected product's image as the base reused by chapter blocks with no image of their own. Falls back to a bundled default when left blank." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_mobile", "label": "Base image (mobile)", "info": "Used only in the no-chapters fallback layout below. Falls back to the desktop base image when left blank." },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "media_fit", "label": "Media fit (no-chapters fallback only)", "default": "contain",
      "info": "Only applies when this section has no chapter blocks at all. Contain shows the whole piece at its true proportions; cover fills an editorial frame and may crop the edges.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "contain", "label": "Contain — preserve the full piece" },
        { "value": "cover", "label": "Cover — fill an editorial frame" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Label", "default": "Object in focus" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Every line earns its place." },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Colour", "default": "bone",
      "info": "Warm Bone is the intended default — keeps the jewellery itself as the brightest visual focus.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "bone", "label": "Warm Bone" },
        { "value": "cinnabar", "label": "Cinnabar" },
        { "value": "obsidian", "label": "Obsidian" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "spacing", "label": "Section spacing", "default": "standard",
      "options": [
        { "value": "compact", "label": "Compact" },
        { "value": "standard", "label": "Standard" },
        { "value": "spacious", "label": "Spacious" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "No-media, no-chapters fallback" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Only ever shown if this section has zero chapter blocks AND no base image, product, or bundled default resolves — effectively unreachable with the settings below at their defaults." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_seal_watermark", "label": "Show House Seal watermark in the material field", "default": true },
    { "type": "range", "id": "seal_watermark_opacity", "label": "Watermark opacity", "min": 5, "max": 12, "step": 1, "default": 8, "unit": "%" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Call to action" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_text", "label": "CTA label", "default": "Discover the object" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "link_url", "label": "CTA link (overrides the selected product's own page when set)" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "name": "Chapter",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Chapter image (optional)", "info": "A dedicated macro/detail image for this chapter's media state. Falls back to the section's base image, cropped distinctly, when left blank." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "info": "e.g. Stone, Setting, Gold, Silhouette, Craft, Hallmark" },
        { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Body" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Object in focus",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "chapter", "settings": { "title": "Stone", "body": "<p>A study in clarity, proportion, and light.</p>" } },
        { "type": "chapter", "settings": { "title": "Design", "body": "<p>Precision begins long before the final form.</p>" } },
        { "type": "chapter", "settings": { "title": "Gold", "body": "<p>A considered finish, true to the House's material language.</p>" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
